{
  model: 'qwen/qwen3.8-27b',
  temperature: 0.1,
  max_tokens: 2048,
  response_format: {
    type: 'json_object'
  },

  messages: [
    {
      role: 'system',
      content: `You are a QA engineer.
Analyze only evidence visible in the screenshot and supplied logs.

Return JSON with:
- title
- description
- steps_to_reproduce (array)
- expected_behavior
- actual_behavior
- environment
- severity (Blocker|Critical|Major|Minor|Trivial)
- visual_clues (array)

Clearly state when a detail is unknown.
Never invent interaction steps or technical causes.`
    },
    {
      role: 'user',
      content: [
        {
          type: 'text',
          text: `Analyze this UI screenshot. Error logs: ${$json.errorLogs || 'None provided'}`
        },
        {
          type: 'image_url',
          image_url: {
            url: $json.imageDataUrl
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
}}

